{
  "name": "HubMessage - Test all operations",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# How to use\n\n1. Configure a production HubMessage API credential.\n2. Fill in the **Config** node.\n3. All HubMessage nodes start disabled to prevent accidental changes and message sends.\n4. Assign your credential to the nodes you want to test.\n5. Enable and run **one operation at a time**.\n\nThe workflow contains all 17 documented operations: 2 Channel, 9 Message, and 6 Template operations.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -840
      ],
      "id": "5ab14a9e-e6d4-4ab5-96b4-f0da13bb7844",
      "name": "Instructions"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Meta channel rule\n\n**Text, media, contact, and interactive messages:** the customer must have sent a message within the last 24 hours.\n\n**To start or resume a conversation:** use **Message → Send Template** with a Meta-approved template.\n\nUnofficial WhatsApp channels may behave differently. The channel type currently documented by this node is `META_WHATSAPP`.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 3
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        -840
      ],
      "id": "91549843-7771-4397-a9ea-8aa98472ad55",
      "name": "24-hour rule"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Listing WABAs\n\nTemplate → Get Many WABAs uses the official GET /whatsapp/businesses endpoint. During integration testing, this endpoint returned an empty list even with a connected Meta channel; HubMessage confirmed that it was investigating the backend behavior. Until a production fix is confirmed, an empty response may reflect this known limitation rather than insufficient Secret Key permissions.\n\nThe WABA ID also supports expressions in operations that use it. Template dropdowns load only when a literal WABA is selected.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        -840
      ],
      "id": "c63ee39a-c31d-41b9-98b4-73a4d0377a26",
      "name": "WABA note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Caution\n\n**Create Channel**, **Connect Channel**, **Create/Update/Delete Template**, and all message operations modify external data.\n\nDo not enable all of them at the same time. **Delete Template is permanent.** The Connect SDK authorization code is temporary and must be replaced before testing.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 2
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1640,
        -840
      ],
      "id": "6db337de-246a-4a06-b63c-af1d04d8c65b",
      "name": "Operations with side effects"
    },
